Boudewijn described a way to do this in an unmodified game..
but if you can compile the game yourself, you might like the splittable
adjust patch that Sam Dennis wrote. 
It makes it possible to use count with the #adjust command, so if you have
10 daggers in inventory slot a, you can say
#adjust 1 a b 
to move one of them to slot b.

